#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:136
msgid "If a language model is set up in Settings > Telegram bot, the bot also answers plain messages. In a private chat it answers questions about tasks, events, the site's pages and the official email address (the contact in Settings > Privacy), and can sign a member up for a task or take them off one; it asks them to confirm with a button first. It remembers a private chat for 24 hours, and in the group what each person wrote to it, separately, also for 24 hours. It knows each person's roles and leaves out what is meant only for others. When an organizer writes to it privately, it also knows this guide and the infrastructure note. In the group it answers only when the message is meant for the bot and it knows the answer. When someone in a private chat gives feedback, is unhappy or very happy, or asks for a human, every organizer gets that chat by email and a short Telegram message, at most once per person per hour (switch it off in Settings > Telegram bot)."
msgstr "如果在 设置 > Telegram 机器人 中设置了语言模型，机器人也会回答普通消息。在私聊中，它回答有关任务、活动、网站页面和官方邮箱地址（设置 > 隐私 中的联系方式）的问题，并可以为成员报名或取消任务；它会先请对方用按钮确认。它会把私聊记住 24 小时，在群里则分别记住每个人对它说的话，同样是 24 小时。它知道每个人的角色，并会略去只面向他人的内容。组织者私下给它写信时，它还知道本指南和基础设施说明。在群里，它只在消息是发给机器人且它知道答案时才回答。当有人在私聊中提供反馈、表示不满或非常满意，或要求找真人时，每位组织者都会通过邮件收到该聊天，并收到一条简短的 Telegram 消息，每人每小时最多一次（在 设置 > Telegram 机器人 中关闭）。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:778
msgid "If an organizer puts you on a guest list with your email address, we store your name, your email address, how many people you bring and the date of the event. We email you a thank-you message with your ticket in the same way, and use the rest to check you in at the door."
msgstr "如果组织者用你的邮箱地址把你加到嘉宾名单上，我们会保存你的名字、邮箱地址、你带来的人数和活动日期。我们会以同样方式给你发一封附有票的感谢邮件，其余信息用于在门口为你签到。"

#. translators: %s: "the English original" (or another language), a link to the original page
#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:298
msgid "If the translation and %s differ, the original applies."
msgstr "如果译文与%s不一致，以原文为准。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:794
msgid "If you are on a guest list with your email address, you get the same message after the event."
msgstr "如果你以邮箱地址在嘉宾名单上，活动结束后你也会收到同样的消息。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:786
msgid "If you are removed from the guest list after your ticket was emailed, we email you that your ticket is cancelled."
msgstr "如果你的票通过邮件发出后你被移出嘉宾名单，我们会发邮件告诉你，你的票已取消。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:757
msgid "If you join our next events announcement, we store your email address, whether you have confirmed it or left the announcement, the date you signed up and the date you confirmed. We also store the name you want us to greet you with, if you give one, and the language your browser prefers (Finnish or English). You can change the name and the language, or leave, with the link at the end of every announcement. When you leave, the name is deleted."
msgstr "如果你加入我们的下一次活动公告，我们会保存你的邮箱地址、你是否已确认或已退出公告、你注册的日期和确认的日期。如果你提供了希望我们称呼你的名字，我们也会保存，以及你的浏览器首选的语言（芬兰文或英文）。你可以用每条公告末尾的链接更改名字和语言，或退出。退出后，名字会被删除。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:852
msgid "If you join the next events announcement, we keep your email address for the announcement until you leave it. You can leave it at any time with the link in every announcement. When you leave, we keep your address marked as left, and send you no more announcements."
msgstr "如果你加入下一次活动公告，我们会为公告保留你的邮箱地址，直到你退出。你可以随时用每条公告中的链接退出。退出后，我们会把你的地址标记为已退出，并不再给你发送公告。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:479
msgid "If you link a Telegram account, we store its numeric account and chat identifiers so the bot can recognise you and message you. We do not store your Telegram username or phone number."
msgstr "如果你关联了 Telegram 账户，我们会保存其数字账户和聊天标识符，以便机器人识别你并给你发消息。我们不保存你的 Telegram 用户名或电话号码。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:856
msgid "If you press \"Don't send me these\" in the message after the event, we keep your email address on a do-not-send list, so that we send you no more of these messages."
msgstr "如果你在活动后的消息中点了“不要再发给我”，我们会把你的邮箱地址保存在免发送名单中，不再给你发送这类消息。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:494
msgid "If you sign in with Telegram, the Crew app makes a one-time code and puts a cookie in your browser that ties the code to that browser. The bot uses your Telegram account number to find your crew account. The code and the cookie expire after 30 minutes and cannot be used twice."
msgstr "如果你用 Telegram 登录，团队应用会生成一个一次性代码，并在你的浏览器中放一个 cookie，把代码与该浏览器绑定。机器人用你的 Telegram 账户号码找到你的团队账户。代码和 cookie 在 30 分钟后过期，且不能使用两次。"

#. translators: %d: number of days
#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:862
msgid "If you sign up for the next events announcement but do not confirm your address, the sign-up is deleted after %d days."
msgstr "如果你注册了下一次活动公告但没有确认地址，注册会在 %d 天后删除。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:694 src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:890
msgid "If you think we have handled your data badly, you can complain to your national data protection authority. In the EU you can complain to the one where you live, work, or where the problem happened."
msgstr "如果你认为我们对你的数据处理不当，可以向你所在国家的数据保护机构投诉。在欧盟，你可以向你居住地、工作地或问题发生地的机构投诉。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:782
msgid "If your ticket was missing from our door list and the door desk adds you with your email address, we email you your ticket in the same way."
msgstr "如果我们的门口名单上没有你的票，而门口的工作人员用你的邮箱地址添加了你，我们会以同样方式把票通过邮件发给你。"

